  "question": "Define a polynomial $f(x)$ by $f(x)=\\begin{vmatrix}1&x&x\\\\x&1&x\\\\x&x&1\\end{vmatrix}$ for all $x\\in\\mathbb R$, where the right hand side above is a determinant. Then the roots of $f(x)$ are of the form",
