    "C": "$\\alpha,\\beta,\\gamma$ where $\\alpha,\\beta,\\gamma\\in\\mathbb R$ are all distinct.",
    "D": "$\\alpha,\\alpha,\\alpha$ for some $\\alpha\\in\\mathbb R$."
